  "solution": "**Logic: Second no. = [(First no. + Third no.) × 5]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**5 - 70 - 9 →**\n\n​⇒ [(5 + 9) × 5]\n\n​⇒ (14 × 5) = 70\n\n**8 - 95 - 11 →**\n\n​⇒ [(8 + 11) × 5]\n\n​⇒ (19 × 5) = 95\n\nChecking the given options:\n\n**(1)** 12 - 144 - 15 →\n\n​⇒ [(12 + 15) × 5]\n\n​⇒ (27 × 5) = 135\n\n**(2) **17 - 135 - 21 →\n\n​⇒ [(17 + 21) × 5]\n\n​⇒ (38 × 5) = 190\n\n**(3)** 6 - 135 - 21 →\n\n​⇒ [(6 + 21) × 5]\n\n​⇒ (27 × 5) = **135**\n\n**(4)** 4 - 28- 79 →\n\n​⇒ [(79 + 4) × 5]\n\n​⇒ (83 × 5) = 415\n\nHere,** '6 - 135 - 21' **is similar to the given sets of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (3)\".\n\n45:Td7b,\n\n<",
